      "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe relationship between cohomology and <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech cohomology comes from the fact\nthat the <GROUPOPEN_0002><ACCENT_0002><GROUPCLOSE_0002>ech cohomology of an injective abelian sheaf is zero. To see this\nwe note that an injective abelian sheaf is an injective abelian presheaf and\nthen we apply results in <GROUPOPEN_0003><ACCENT_0003><GROUPCLOSE_0003>ech cohomology in the preceding section.\n\n",
      "source_text_hash": "sha256:7bd020ea70bd9165b746466815827baf737d3fc22a592392c127fba987c8e7ac",
