      "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ac3c0b7335b87a9495f95f635a6597230c365d05eb754fc674dd7fd2152e3342",
      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site. An injective abelian sheaf is also injective as an\nobject in the category <MATH_0002>.\n",
