      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a covering of <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an injective abelian sheaf, i.e., an injective\nobject of <MATH_0005>.\nThen\n<MATHSEG_0001>if<MATHSEG_0002>if<MATHSEG_0003>\n",
