          "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category. Let\n<MATH_0002> be a family of morphisms\nwith fixed target such that all fibre products\n<MATH_0003> exist in <MATH_0004>.\nThe <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech cohomology functors <MATH_0005>\nare canonically isomorphic as a <MATH_0006>-functor to\nthe right derived functors of the functor\n<MATH_0007>\nMoreover, there is a functorial quasi-isomorphism\n<MATH_0008>\nwhere the right hand side indicates the derived functor\n<MATH_0009>\nof the left exact functor <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
          "source_status": "CURRENT",
